Revision history for PDF-Combiner

{{$NEXT}}
    - Compresses the final product to 150 DPI as default
      + uses module 'PDF::Compress' to enable compressing pdfs
      + has options for 300 DPI or no compression
    - Adds cabability to convert a Rakudoc file to a PDF based on the
        Pod::To::PDF module by David Warring
    - Updated docs accordingly
    - Ensures a single doc can get page numbering
    - Added important tags: pdf pod markdown convert pod2pdf

0.0.1  2023-11-09T17:31:12-06:00
